request.description:
### HTTP POST /payouts/transfer

Make transfer from your Payscribe wallet to bank

**Request Body**

- amount: String (required) - The amount you are sending

- bank: String (required) - The bank code you're sending to.

- account: String (required) - The recipient account number

- currency: String (optional) - The currency of the transaction: Default is NGN

- narration: String (required) - Description of the transaction

- ref: String (required) - Reference for the transaction


**Response**

