request.description:
### Update Customer Tier 2

This endpoint is used to upgrade a customer to tier 2 in order to process services like Collections.

#### Request Body

- `customer_id` (String, required): The customer id that was generated when creating the customer.

- `identity` (Object, required): An object of the customer identity.
    - `type` (String, required): Governmental identity type. For example, NIN, PASSPORT, VIN.

    - `number` (String, required): The identity number.

    - `country` (String, required): Country ISO where the identity was issued.

    - `image` (String, required): A clear image of the identity.


#### Response

The response will be in JSON format with the following schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "details": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "customer_id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "status_code": {
      "type": "integer"
    }
  }
}

